# Wave W-DIFF4: mossroof — moss-timber roof of Cinder Town
# (Charcoal & Kiln Brick kit). Horizontal timber courses with
# moss clumping along the course bottoms, in the KIT_VARIANTS
# azalea roof tones (#5d8a4a / #3c5c2e / #84a866, timber seam
# #6b4a26) — the forest-edge timber of JOHTO_TOWN_STYLE azalea's
# form line, drawn as moss-grown planks rather than shingle so
# Cinder's houses read as mossy timber where Redwood's read as
# deep pine. Solid wall-class roof tile, swapped onto
# house-stamp roof cells only (W-DIFF drakeroof precedent).
